<!--
  Bokeya brand mark — Bengali "ব".

  Concept: one settled ledger entry.
    * The matra (top rule) and stem are the record itself — a ruled ledger line.
    * The bowl is a single continuous flow drawn in two tones: it leaves the stem in white
      (আমি দেব — what goes out), turns at the far edge, and returns in accent
      (আমি পাব — what comes back), closing into the stem where the entry settles.
  One stroke out, one stroke back, closed = balance. Legible down to launcher size.
-->
